    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Li Yizhong used to make large "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "sculptures",
            "zh": "雕塑"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for office buildings and museums around Jinan. One day, however, a friend asked Li to make a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "miniature",
            "zh": "微缩模型"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of his "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " home. The artist posted the finished product on social media. To his surprise, "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "numerous",
            "ref": "v-numerous"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " netizens expressed their love for his work. From then on, Li decided to make miniature homes for "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Today, about half of Li’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "clients",
            "zh": "客户"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " are people in their thirties. The "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " are older. Most, like the artist himself, were born and raised in the countryside. After growing up, they moved to the cities to find education and jobs. While some "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their childhood through old photos, others choose to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "relive",
            "zh": "重温"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their memories by turning to Li for help."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Born in 1983 in Shandong province, Li comes from a(n) "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " family. “Before I went to college, I always helped my family with the farm work, and I am very "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with everything in my hometown. As I grew older, I became more "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "emotional",
            "ref": "v-emotional"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about it. After all, it was the place of a happy childhood. Many of my works also "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "reflect",
            "ref": "v-reflect"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " these beautiful memories,” says the 41-year-old."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Li says he knows more about houses in the north. Still, thanks to people’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "vivid",
            "zh": "生动的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " descriptions and the pictures they "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for his "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "reference",
            "ref": "v-reference"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", the artist usually has enough to base his work on."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "And the work is, not surprisingly, highly complex. It usually takes one to two months to complete one model. Each model is made up of hundreds of small pieces and involves about 50 different "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", such as wood board, paper, iron wire, and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "gypsum plaster",
            "zh": "石膏水泥"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The finished products are complete with everything: the stone walls, the courtyard, and clothes drying on a clothesline. Some have even got "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " televisions or electric fans."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Li likes what he’s doing. “This is more meaningful” than his "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "previous",
            "ref": "v-previous"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " work, he says. “There’s more feeling and more "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ".”"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
